25,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Transport costs vary wildly depending on distance. Also, whole-building lets have non-refundable deposits if people drop out.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Shion,,"Our own hall is crowded during vacation, and inland centers can be cramped with strict lights-out policies.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Minato,,"Public bookings require a tedious nine-page application and a lottery. Also, cooking for ourselves on campus is a huge burden.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"Public beds are cheap, but attendance sheets show a significant number of people skip away camps entirely.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"Seniors say mixing happens during shared evenings. Also, many members can't reach campus by 9 AM without overnight stays.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, if people can't reach campus, a local camp might still require paying for beds.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Minato, if the application is that difficult, maybe we should avoid public centers.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shion, I agree. It sounds like a lot of work for the organizers.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Asuka, the non-refundable deposit for lodges sounds risky given the attendance trends I found.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Misaki, but if we stay on campus, we might not get the social bonding we need.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, but the cost of transport is a huge factor. Staying local is the safest for the budget.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, but the hall timetable is a mess. We'd be training at odd hours.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Misaki, do you think the cheap public beds outweigh the lottery risk?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Misaki,,Not if the paperwork is a nightmare and people don't show up.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Takumi,,We need a place where everyone actually stays together.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"We have to balance the budget, the workload, and the actual attendance.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,4,talk,Shion,,"A private lodge might be too expensive or risky, and the hall is too busy.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,4,talk,Minato,,I just don't want the organizers to spend all their time cooking or filling out forms.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I'm leaning away from the lodge due to the deposit risk.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,4,talk,Takumi,,I still think the Mountain Centre or Lodge is better for the club's spirit.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
