50,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Option B is the cheapest, but the scheduling and commute are issues. Option A is cheap but risky to book.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Shion,,Option B's timetable is terrible. Option A's sleeping conditions are poor. Option C is the most comfortable.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Minato,,Option A has too much paperwork. Option B has too much cooking. Option C seems the most relaxing.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Option C is a financial risk if people cancel. Option A is stable but the lottery is a gamble.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Takumi,,"Option C or A ensures we all sleep in one place, which is the only way to fix the year-group divide.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, the financial risk of Option C is too high for me. I vote for Option B.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, B is impractical. I'll vote for Option C for the quality of the experience.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Minato,,I can't handle the cooking or the forms. I vote for Option C.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Misaki,,I can't support C's deposit terms. I'll vote for Option A; it's the safest budget-wise.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Takumi,,I'm voting for Option C. We need the bonding.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
